&_nc_oc=AdqlVa1wJ08w8E4eMhdp2dpQ19n0qjDbr1CT1Sd4o7KMQrK2EIsJ0GYvwO7ctL2TkLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7eEN3O1ny_HRbGssBGvscGTRx83a01hv14tWlYqpGXGg&oe=6A0F21BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ypoXFx1vrUQ7kNvwH7XJLr&_nc_oc=AdpB9Ikz7chteSkBtEeP2XXCLIpZ4IIX5D7aSrHeNrcTZ5cQae_KcoQgZycgDan3Ub0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7F3vfcYSUOZU2f4ohlDxEu-1ibyISzmrP2YDSR0mPT-g&oe=6A0EFA7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jIKrkcK0RGIQ7kNvwFfZq2-&_nc_oc=Adr4ZhkxjIw_tG5S5IkZd7j7x6qPiDdJJj8qA6pbAflZVX5DoYrg-JTZR62tSN7Laqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5hSPLJQcl6bHR01bDf59aMrHdUmCOjCmVUzoYedQ-rgQ&oe=6A0F1907"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gWAJ-6-FTucQ7kNvwEKqeGT&_nc_oc=Adr9vJlB3ZDmPzH2JYXn9E95u2k7uIZKQAEata1REkVxQy8wkMPdz6dC8KwF1PtaUUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4PKtnC9bgENjnND9R6fWrPf8YddO_uHKNigG288a0C5A&oe=6A0F04D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DkZYcEPDM-MQ7kNvwHNObN1&_nc_oc=AdrmtPIbGwxgk0of0zO795EK5mBQO96P9s9P0NaCWSiuMm7bY8u0TR_LlWJGjBaOd3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7v8FFL8gu8Y-Pi5vY1olU6yxmTfFLar805K9nEwKAbTA&oe=6A0F1164"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.